    "noStateFabrication": "After initial placement/speed/gear, only rider controls are written. No wheel force, suspension travel, airborne state, position or attitude is assigned.",
    "comparison": "Reset terrain before each independent traversal. Compare same motorcycle and course section with identical speed target, scripted driver and no input to artificial animation.",
    "window": "Measure fork range, front-contact force range and count airborne ticks from 5 m after entry to 3 m before exit, excluding the transition ramps.",
    "completion": "Integrate until course station reaches the entry end, with 1600 steps maximum. All recorded traversals reached the end with zero crashes.",
    "airborneMetric": "Total sampled two-tyre airborne ticks in the measurement window, not maximum flight duration or a full-lap statistic.",
    "speedLabels": "9 and 13 m/s are control targets (32.4 and 46.8 km/h), not claimed measured constant speeds.",
    "riderProfile": "The existing rigBike retains aiControlled(1e9), its calibrated AI/NOVICE riding and air-pitch aids. Player-specific brake/traction behavior is covered separately by existing riding tests.",
    "collisionScope": "Direct DirtBikeVehicle.step integration on production terrain; no race collision-solver pass or multiplayer interaction is inserted.",
    "quietLanePrecision": "The revalidation reuses the recorded quiet-lane inputs exactly. The 65% width relation is checked within 1e-12 m to allow coordinate roundoff."
